           "Pre-check from the machine: `azcmagent check --location westeurope` (add `--enable-pls-check` for Private Link, `--extensions all` for extension endpoints). Skip the machine in this wave if a required endpoint is unreachable.",
           "Connect with the onboarding service principal: `azcmagent connect --service-principal-id <appId> --service-principal-secret <secret> --tenant-id <tenant> --subscription-id <sub> --resource-group rg-arc-prod-weu --location westeurope --tags \"Environment=Prod,Site=STO1,PatchRing=ProdA\" --enable-automatic-upgrade`. Add `--private-link-scope <scope-id>` or `--gateway-id <gateway-id>` for those patterns, and `--verbose` during pilots.",
