           "In Azure: Azure Arc > Machines filtered by the wave's resource group, or a Resource Graph query on `resources | where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines' | project name, resourceGroup, location, status = tostring(properties.status), os = tostring(properties.osName), tags`.",
           "List extensions per machine (Microsoft's sample query joins `microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions` to the machines) and compare against what policy should have deployed.",
